note cabi-1 fixture external unit: tools/bridge-seeded c emits omega_fx_sum, the symbol fixture.om imports through fx_ext.
note fixture.om passes a uchar view span, a ulong edit span at element offset 0 and a ulong view span at element offset 3.
fn fx_sum b view uchar 512 n ulong w edit ulong 3 v view ulong 3 k ulong to ulong
s = k
for j ulong n
s = add s ulong get b j
end
for i ulong 3
s = add s get v i
put w i 7
end
ret s
end
